# Telefon updates (marvar.id)

Public media base (clients check/download from here):

- Base: `https://marvar.id/media/telefon/`
- Update URL (shell default): `https://marvar.id/media/telefon/telefon.exe`
- Manifest: `https://marvar.id/media/telefon/update.json`
- Package: `https://marvar.id/media/telefon/telefon.zip`

SFTP publish target (maps to that media folder):

- Host: `marvar.id`
- Port: `2022` (SFTP)
- User: `cursor`
- Password: `simsim@qiyinekan`
- Remote dir: `/telefon/`

After `npm run build`, artifacts upload automatically via Paramiko SFTP into `/telefon/` (`npm run upload:update` to retry). Credentials live in `.env` (`TELEFON_SFTP_*`, `TELEFON_UPDATE_*`). Do not commit real passwords to git-tracked examples.
